Emerging Market Opportunities
Battery and Electric Vehicle Applications
The expansion of electric vehicle manufacturing is creating opportunities for PTFE-based venting materials used in battery enclosures and protective components. These membranes can support pressure equalization while helping protect equipment from moisture and contaminants.

Hydrogen and Fuel Cell Technologies
Investment in hydrogen infrastructure and fuel-cell systems is creating potential demand for specialized membrane materials. PTFE's chemical resistance and durability offer opportunities in selected filtration and gas-management applications.

Advanced Water and Wastewater Treatment
Growing emphasis on water reuse and industrial wastewater treatment is increasing interest in durable filtration technologies. PTFE membrane systems can serve applications involving aggressive chemicals and demanding operating conditions.

